### Commented entries have reasonable defaults.
### Uncomment to edit them.
# Source: <source package name; defaults to package name>
Section: database
Priority: optional
Standards-Version: 3.9.2

Package: mongodb-server
Version: 4.4.30
Maintainer: conmilo <noreply@github.com>
Provides: mongodb-org-server (= 4.4.30), mongodb-10gen (= 4.4.30)
Architecture: amd64
Description: MongoDB 4.4 server equivs stub
 This is a metapackage that satisfies the UniFi Video controller
 .deb's hard dependency on
   mongodb-10gen (>= 2.4.10)
   | mongodb-org-server (>= 2.6.0)
   | mongodb-server (>= 2.4.9)
 .
 The real MongoDB 4.4.x server binaries are shipped to /opt/mongodb-4.4/
 by the Dockerfile in a separate step, with the 4.2.x server (mongod-only,
 ~71 MB stripped via the mongo42-extractor stage) alongside at
 /opt/mongodb-4.2/ used once by migrate-mongo.sh during the 4.0 -> 4.2
 -> 4.4 featureCompatibilityVersion bridge. Neither tarball install
 registers with dpkg, hence this stub.
 .
 If you ever need to remove the real MongoDB binaries, this stub will
 still satisfy unifi-video's dependency check on subsequent reinstalls
 (which is the only edge case where that matters).
